I built the platform around the Microsoft Azure ecosystem and Microsoft Foundry because I wanted to explore the capabilities available for building enterprise-oriented agentic systems within a major cloud platform.

The project brings together Microsoft Foundry and Foundry Agent Service with Azure's infrastructure, monitoring, governance, identity, security and cost-management capabilities.

